/* font8x16.c - 8x16 bitmap font table for ASCII 32-126.
 *
 * Hand-authored and visually verified glyph-by-glyph (see the
 * generation/verification process in project notes) rather than
 * transcribed from an external font binary - every glyph was
 * rendered as ASCII art and checked to actually look like its
 * intended character before being converted to these byte values.
 * Codepoints outside 32-126, and any not yet defined, render as
 * a hollow box (visibly a placeholder, never a silently-wrong shape).
 *
 * Row format: one byte per scanline, MSB = leftmost pixel, 16 rows
 * per glyph (8x16 cell). gfx_terminal.c blits each glyph scaled 2x
 * to fill a 16x32 screen cell - see FONT_SCALE in gfx_terminal.c.
 */

